---
const quotes = [
  {
    name: 'Austin',
    role: 'Member',
    quote:
      "I joined to learn options without blowing up my account. The risk-defined framework — covered calls, credit spreads, the wheel — actually makes sense now. I run a covered-call ladder on positions I'd hold anyway. Boring works.",
  },
  {
    name: 'Rollin',
    role: 'Member',
    quote:
      "Most communities push the next ten-bagger. This one teaches you how to hold a position for two years through a 25% drawdown without panicking. The thesis stays written down where you can check it.",
  },
  {
    name: 'Marcus',
    role: 'Member',
    quote:
      "The Smart Money tab changed how I read the tape. Watching what insiders and Congress are actually buying — not what CNBC is saying about it — is a different game.",
  },
  {
    name: 'Drew',
    role: 'Member',
    quote:
      "Most discord servers are noise. This one's the opposite. Every closed position gets reviewed, including the losers. You can see the work.",
  },
  {
    name: 'Cody',
    role: 'Member',
    quote:
      "I've been in three other communities. None of them showed you the framework — they just dropped tickers. Here you actually understand why a name made the watchlist before anyone tells you to buy.",
  },
];
---

<section class="container-wide py-14 md:py-24">
  <div class="grid gap-6 md:gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16 lg:items-end">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <p class="eyebrow">From the floor</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-display-lg uppercase tracking-tight">
        What members <span class="text-signal">actually say.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <p class="text-bone-dim">
        Real members, real positions, in their own words. No paid placements, no
        scripts.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="mt-8 md:mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {quotes.map((q) => (
      <li class:list={['card flex flex-col', q.role === 'Partner' && 'border-signal/30']}>
        <svg
          class="h-6 w-6 flex-none text-signal/60"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 32 32"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M9.352 4C4.456 4 0 8.456 0 13.352c0 4.18 3.04 7.852 7.18 8.708-.36 1.464-1.46 2.92-3.18 4.04l-.62.4.6.42c1.44 1.04 3.32 1.5 5.18 1.08 4.16-.84 7.32-4.42 7.34-8.66.04-7.06-2.96-15.34-7.148-15.34zm15.296 0C19.752 4 15.296 8.456 15.296 13.352c0 4.18 3.04 7.852 7.18 8.708-.36 1.464-1.46 2.92-3.18 4.04l-.62.4.6.42c1.44 1.04 3.32 1.5 5.18 1.08 4.16-.84 7.32-4.42 7.34-8.66.04-7.06-2.96-15.34-7.148-15.34z" />
        </svg>

        <p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-bone-dim">{q.quote}</p>

        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-bone/10 pt-4">
          <p class="font-display text-lg tracking-tight text-bone">{q.name}</p>
          <span class:list={[
            'rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest',
            q.role === 'Partner'
              ? 'border-signal/40 bg-signal/10 text-signal'
              : 'border-bone/15 text-bone-mute',
          ]}>
            {q.role}
          </span>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</section>
